  "raw": "\nThis is basically it, and a shrug of the shoulder (this affix adds 1 AP worth for your attacks) as long as no one sees it coming from afar.  So yeah shoot ya' old man! :D\nYou do realize that by attacking innocent people people populate pathfinder right? Every player SHOULD be serial killer or maimer, anything defensive should be avoided like the plague. From NPCs to Children there seems to exist 2 groups one that avoid whatever anything scares them (howland reedTheon Jerryheart Covellnys foresworn Diarthrimor Restless Maitrich Orthwander)...and then there are normal passerby that become murder machines lol.\nI'm saying I don't want people running at me who see ancients doing high-end healing. Standing around having someone healthbar shot off isn't scary anymore. Or running out to pierce your tank with spears and small rings so you get magic bolt knoweadged, only to then",
